\par\par \b \uc2 UPDATE: SNB: Time For Exit Strategy Hasn't Yet Arrived - Jordan\b0\par\par\uc2 493 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 2 November 2009\par 19:58\par \uc2 Dow Jones International News\par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2009 Dow Jones & Company, Inc.   \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par  (Updated to add details on monetary policy, beginning in 13th paragraph.) \par  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 BERN (Dow Jones)--The worst of the financial crisis has passed but it would be premature to hike rates, \f28 \uc2 \f2 Swiss National Bank\f28 \uc2 \f2  directorate member \f28 \uc2 \f2 Thomas Jordan\f28 \uc2 \f2  said Monday.\f28 \par \par \uc2 "The worst is behind us but there isn't enough stability to talk about an exit strategy as yet," Jordan said in a speech in Bern.\par \par \uc2 He added the biggest challenge for policymakers is the timing of any exit strategy--the return to a higher interest rate level consistent with long-term price stability.\par \par \uc2 The current stimulus stemming from record-low rates will have to disappear at some stage to prevent a surge in inflation in a few years' time, according to Jordan.\par \par \uc2 However, the path to a normalized monetary policy will be a stony one, he said.\par \par \uc2 "The timing of the exit strategy will be crucial, and it will also be tough to communicate," Jordan said, adding that the SNB's overriding goal remains price stability.\par \par \uc2 Among the positive recent signs are the fact that banks have begun lending to each other and that credit risk premiums haven come down. Also, there is no sight of a credit crunch in \b \highlight22\uc2 Switzerland\b0 \highlight\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 He said the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  policy begun last March has been successful, saying, "As a consequence, the volatility in the Swiss franc has decreased."\par \par \uc2 He didn't comment on last week's speculation the Swiss \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  bought foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  to drive the Swiss franc lower.\par \par \uc2 UBS AG (\uc2 UBS\uc2 ), the only Swiss bank that needed government support to survive the crisis, is on the path to recovery, Jordan said.\par \par \uc2 The risk to the SNB stemming from the so-called StabFund, a special vehicle for \uc2 UBS\uc2 's toxic assets, has halved to around $25 billion compared with some $54 billion earlier this year, according to Jordan.\par \par \uc2 Jordan added that the dollar will in all probability remain the world's bellwether \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the foreseeable future.\par \par \uc2 In March, the SNB slashed its interest rate target for the three-month Swiss franc London interbank offered rate, its benchmark rate, to a record low of 0.25% and started \b \highlight22\uc2 intervening\b0 \highlight\uc2  in \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  markets to curb the Swiss francs rise. Most market watchers expect the SNB to continue its expansionary monetary policy well into 2010.\par \par \uc2 Other unconventional monetary policy measures, or quantitative easing, included long-term repo transaction and the purchase of Swiss franc bonds of private issuers.\par \par \uc2 Jordan didn't indicate whether and when the SNB would phase out those measures. The SNB has no official exchange rate target, but is believed to consider \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  at a level of CHF1.50 to the euro.\par \par \uc2 On the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market, the euro traded at around CHF1.51 before Jordan's speech.\par \par \uc2 -By Martin Gelnar, Dow Jones Newswires; +41 79 821 5617, martin.gelnar@dowjones.com [ 02-11-09 1858GMT ]\par \par \uc2 Dokument DJI0000020091102e5b2001gr\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
