\highlight\uc2  market at 0930 GMT, the euro was trading at CHF1.5224.\par \par \uc2 Commenting on a recent cash call by UBS AG (\uc2 UBS\uc2 ), the Swiss bank most affected by investment in sub-prime mortgage securities, Jordan said, "it was a good decision and a step in the right direction."\par \par \uc2 UBS\uc2  last week announced a capital hike of 3.8 billion Swiss francs ($3.6 billion), its fourth move to raise capital in less than two years.\par \par \uc2 SNB Web site: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "http://www.snb.ch"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 www.snb.ch}}}\par \par \uc2 -By Martin Gelnar, Dow Jones Newswires; +41 43 443 8042; martin.gelnar@dowjones.com\par \par \uc2 (END) Dow Jones Newswires\par \par \uc2 July 02, 2009 05:51 ET (09:51 GMT)\par \par \uc2 Dokument DJDN000020090702e572001wq\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw205\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal3075\pichgoal600
