ith inflation at 0.4 percent there is a danger that some negative event would bring about a fall in consumer prices. But the real danger for us would be franc appreciation, which could be regarded as deflation of imported goods." \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020030618dz6i00gde\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
