\par\par \b \uc2  Swiss franc firms vs dollar after UN report. \b0\par\par\uc2 277 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 28 Januar 2003\par 08:04\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2003 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  ZURICH, Jan 28 (Reuters) - The Swiss franc firmed slightly versus the dollar in early European trade on Tuesday after the UN weapons report on Iraq, but handed in gains made on Monday when the greenback hit multiyear lows versus European \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  The dollar  eased to 1.3554/59 Swiss francs from 1.3561/66 francs late on Monday. It had fallen to as far as 1.3460 during Monday's session ahead of the UN weapons report, seen as a possible trigger for a war in oil-rich Iraq. \par \par \uc2  The euro  also traded slightly softer at 1.4671/78 francs, compared with 1.4684/89 francs in late Monday trade. \par \par \uc2  "There are plenty of risks looming over the franc," UBS Warburg said in a note, adding that history showed the franc tended to strengthen versus other key \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  in times of geopolitical and financial markets uncertainty. \par \par \uc2  "In fact, the strong statements on the independence of the Swiss \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  as of late could motivate some investors into a franc engagement again," it added. \par \par \uc2  Outgoing SNB Vice President Bruno Gehrig said on Friday \b \highlight22\uc2 forex\b0 \highlight\b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  was definitely an instrument of monetary policy in \b \highlight22\uc2 Switzerland\b0 \highlight\uc2 . "But I'm not saying we will do it tomorrow," he added. \par \par \uc2  The SNB has to date been coy on what franc level would trigger action, leaving dealers with the impression that the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  is basically powerless against the franc's rise. \par \par \uc2  While Gehrig's comments reinforce the SNB's stated intention to act, analysts say words from a departing directorate member were less likely to change the course of trading in a major way. \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020030128dz1s00dqi\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
