\par\par \b \uc2  UPDATE 1-Swiss cenbank says would  \highlight22\uc2 intervene \highlight\uc2  if need be on franc. \b0\par\par\uc2  By Tom Armitage \par \uc2 573 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 24 Januar 2003\par 23:36\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2003 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  ST GALLEN, \b \highlight22\uc2 Switzerland\b0 \highlight\uc2 , Jan 24 (Reuters) - The Swiss National Bank said on Friday it would \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  if necessary if the Swiss franc rose too sharply on \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  markets. \par \par \uc2  Outgoing SNB Vice President Bruno Gehrig said in a speech at the university of St. Gallen the biggest risk for the Swiss economy was a rise in the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  serious enough to endanger its stability. \par \par \uc2  "The national bank would decisively act against such a distortion," said Gehrig, who is due to leave the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's three-man policy-making committee in mid-2003 to join insurer Swiss Life. \par \par \uc2  The Swiss franc  on Friday hit a fresh four-year high against the dollar. The dollar has been under pressure for several weeks as investor concerns that a war in Iraq will prove costly for the U.S. economy, prompting the sale of U.S. assets and the flow of cash out of the greenback. \par \par \uc2  "Beyond this, we would if necessary \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  markets to correct an exchange rate distortion and provide the economy with additional liquidity," he added. \par \par \uc2  He told reporters after the speech that he had wanted to make the point that \b \highlight22\uc2 forex intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  was an instrument of monetary policy in \b \highlight22\uc2 Switzerland\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  "But I'm not saying we will do it tomorrow," he added. \par \par \uc2  Gehrig also said that while room for maneuver on interest rates was no longer large, it was not yet exhausted. \par \par \uc2  He added that further moves by the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  - whether a cut in its already low interest rates or market invention - would come if there were signs that Swiss franc strength could have a long-lasting negative impact on the economy. \par \par \uc2  "(The motivation) would be fresh upward pressure on the Swiss franc that would seriously endanger cyclical stability," he said. \par \par \uc2  The SNB has tried to rein in the strength of the franc with a near-zero interest rate policy. It targets the middle of a 0.25 percent to 0.75 percent range for the three-month London Interbank Offered Rate, after cuts of 2.75 percentage points since March 2001. \par \par \uc2  The SNB has made clear that it is concerned about the franc's strength and its effect on the nation's exports, but has restricted itself to trying to contain the upside verbally. \par \par \uc2  Chairman Jean-Pierre Roth said this week the SNB still had some room for maneuver on rates and the bank would become more active in the case of disturbances which drive the franc up on the dollar and euro, the unit of main trading partner Germany. \par \par \uc2  While Gehrig's comments reinforce the SNB's stated intention to act, analysts say words from a departing directorate member were less likely to change the course of trading in a major way. \par \par \uc2  Riding on the Christian Democrat (CVP) party ticket, former UBS (UBSZn.VX) chief economist Peter Buomberger has been widely tipped as the frontrunner to replace Gehrig. He is seen as a strong proponent of acting against franc strength. \par \par \uc2  The U.S. dollar last traded at around 1.3531/37 francs at 2220 GMT vs 1.3575/81 earlier on Friday, while the euro was at 1.4657/59 against 1.4641/47. (Reporting by Tom Armitage, edited by Gary Crosse; zurich.newsroom@reuters.com; Reuters Messaging: tom.armitage.reuters.com@reuters.net; +41 1 631 7506). \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020030124dz1o017iv\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
