\par\par \b \uc2  BIS- \highlight22\uc2 FX intervention \highlight\uc2  may not be a strong option now. \b0\par\par\uc2 304 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 5 Juni 2000\par 12:39\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2000 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  BASEL, \b \highlight22\uc2 Switzerland\b0 \highlight\uc2 , June 5 (Reuters) - The Bank for International Settlements in its annual report on Monday sidestepped any judgement on whether \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  should be used to address perceived problems with \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  But in remarks in its annual report released on Monday, it suggested this is not a strong option now, although this might perhaps change at some unspecified time in the future. \par \par \uc2  It said the situation in \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  markets could raise the question of what central banks might do "aside from moving policy rates" to address perceived discrepancies. \par \par \uc2  "The current answer appears to be, not much. However, circumstances could conceivably change," it said. \par \par \uc2  It acknowledged that a strong yen and weak euro were "somewhat inconsistent" with domestic economic aims in Japan and euro zone countries. \par \par \uc2  The BIS, a forum for the world's central banks which itself does not \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  in \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  markets, declined to make any direct remarks on when \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  would be appropriate. \par \par \uc2  It noted unilateral \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  by Japan has only limited impact, and bilateral \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  with Europe "has also been eschewed to date, even though, prima facie (at first glance), it would seem potentially useful in the right market conditions". \par \par \uc2  "One reason (\b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  has not been used) might be concerns in Europe that \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  would be misread as signalling a dilution of the committment of the newly created \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  to price stability," it said. \par \par \uc2  As for multilateral \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  which would involve the U.S., "concerns have been expressed that this might be interpreted as the harbinger of a managed global exchange rate system, for which there currently seems to be little official enthusiasm," it said. ((Alice Ratcliffe, Zurich newsroom, tel +41 1 631 73 40, New fax +41 1 251 04 76, email: zurich.newsroom@reuters.com)). \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020010820dw65044pc\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
