\par\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 Intervention \highlight\uc2  May Provide Some Short-Term Aid For Dollar \b0\par\par\uc2  By NICHOLAS HASTINGS \par \uc2 294 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 31 Mai 1995\par 17:04\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1995, Dow Jones & Co., Inc.) \par \par \uc2  LONDON (AP-DJ)--Wednesday's coordinated \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  exercise may provide some short-term support for the dollar against the Deutsche mark and the yen, unlike previous attempts to help the U.S. \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  this year. \par \par \uc2  But, market analysts warned, the impact on the market has been largely psychological and the dollar will only be able to extract longer-term benefits if the \b \highlight22\uc2 operation\b0 \highlight\uc2  is backed by policy. \par \par \uc2  'The key question is whether this is a prelude to interest rate changes,' said Michael Burke, \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  analyst at Citibank in London. If not, he suggested, the dollar will end up right where it started. \par \par \uc2  The exercise, the first \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  by the major central banks since April 5, certainly came as a surprise. \par \par \uc2  Central banks outside the U.S. had previously made it plain they didn't see the dollar's decline as their problem. Although as many as 19 had participated at one stage last year, their presence in later \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  exercises had become conspicuously token. \par \par \uc2  This time round, however, market sources reported a two rounds sharp round of \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  led by the U.S. Federal Reserve and backed by the other countries in the Group of Ten major industrialized nations (G-10). \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  of Ireland confirmed that smaller countries such as itself weren't asked to participate. The group actually consists of eleven countries: the U.S., Japan, Germany, France, Canada, Italy, Britain, the Netherlands, Sweden, Belgium and \b \highlight22\uc2 Switzerland\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  The total amount of \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  was hard to gauge with estimates for the exercise ranging up to $5 billion. Julian Jessop, an economist at Midland Global Markets, described it as 'very aggressive.' \par \par \uc2  (MORE) AP-DOW JONES NEWS 31-05-95 \par \par \uc2  1504GMT \par \par \uc2  1149 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020011025dr5v041pl\par }\par \b \uc2 Zusammenfassung der Suche\b0\par \par  \trowd\trgaph15\trqc\trleft-15 \clvertalt\clbrdrt\brdrs\clbrdrl\brdrs\clbrdrb\brdrs\clbrdrr\brdrs \cellx2000\clvertalt\clbrdrt\brdrs\clbrdrl\brdrs\clbrdrb\brdrs\clbrdrr\brdrs \cellx9072\pard \ql \li0\ri0\widctlpar\intbl\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0 \uc2 Text\cell \pard \ql \li0\ri0\widctlpar\intbl\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0 \li50\uc2 (foreign exchange or fx or forex or currenc*) and (interven* or operation*) and (Switzerland near10 interven*) and (rst=trtw or rst=tprw or rst=tdjw) and (central bank or ministry of finance or treasury ministry or monetary authority)\cell \pard \ql \li0\ri0\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0 {  \trowd\trgaph15\trqc\trleft-15 \clvertalt\clbrdrt\brdrs\clbrdrl\brdrs\clbrdrb\brdrs\clbrdrr\brdrs \cellx2000\clvertalt\clbrdrt\brdrs\clbrdrl\brdrs\clbrdrb\brdrs\clbrdrr\brdrs \cellx9072\row } \trowd\trgaph15\trqc\trleft-15 \clvertalt\clbrdrt\brdrs\clbrdrl\brdrs\clbrdrb\brdrs\clbrdrr\brdrs \cellx2000\clvertalt\clbrdrt\brdrs\clbrdrl\brdrs\clbrdrb\brdrs\clbrdrr\brdrs \cellx9072\pard \ql \li0\ri0\widctlpar\intbl\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0 \uc2 Datum\cell \pard \ql \li0\ri0\widctlpar\intbl\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0 \li50\uc2 01/01/1995 bis 21/08/2023\cell \pard \ql \li0\ri